  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Risk and opportunities of AI on Humanitarian Action conference.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this convening event at Wilton Park to promote the improvement of humanitarian responses globally, the FCDO built on its AI leadership to highlight the lack of consideration of the impact of AI in humanitarian work. This conference brought together humanitarian actors, industry and academic experts to build a joint understanding of the transformational impact, risks and opportunities of AI on humanitarian action, and how AI can be deployed consistently with humanitarian principles.</narrative>
  </description>
